   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ad7a7b89e58b227088b1",
   "sourceHash": "ad7a7b89e58b227088b15f8a51841b4d5f38cf97941a7887a1558f45b1cb9dc4",
   "text": "Kairali Ayurvedic Group 是阿育吠陀疗愈村背后成就卓著的家族，他们传承世代阿育吠陀医生的知识与专长，并不断发扬光大。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_85c0891b1af9fcfec9bc",
   "sourceHash": "85c0891b1af9fcfec9bc43bdc2a5b52746f799ceb6e10f466402c75512a86114",
   "text": "我们的阿育吠陀治疗团队在这家家族经营的企业内接受最优质的阿育吠陀培训，充分受益于我们悠久的阿育吠陀传承。凭借无可挑剔的阿育吠陀诊疗、医疗保健与卫生标准，我们获得了 Green Leaf Certification（绿叶认证）——这是喀拉拉邦政府授予阿育吠陀中心的最高等级评定。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Green Leaf Certification' is an award title kept verbatim with a Chinese gloss; approved term 'Certification' = '颁发证书' (issuing a certificate) does not fit an award name, so not applied here."
   ]
